{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a responsive **About Us hero section** for the DocMed website based on the attached visual reference.
    
    The section should have a clean, professional healthcare design with a white/light background and a two-column desktop layout.
    
    ### Desktop layout
    
    The section should span the full available page width and consist of two main areas:
    
    **Left side – Content**
    
    * Small uppercase eyebrow text above the headline:
      **MENSCHEN. PRODUKTE. BESSERE GESUNDHEIT.**
    
    * Large main headline:
      **Über uns**
    
    * Below the headline, display the following text:
    
      Für uns ist Gesundheitswesen zutiefst persönlich. Hinter jedem medizinischen Produkt steht jemand, der darauf angewiesen ist – ein Patient, eine Gesundheitsfachkraft, ein Betreuer oder eine Person, die ihre Gesundheit und ihr Wohlbefinden verbessern möchte.
    
    * Below this paragraph, display the following sentence in bold:
    
      **Bei DocMed verlieren wir das niemals aus den Augen.**
    
    Use a clear visual hierarchy with generous whitespace. The headline should be significantly larger than the body copy.
    
    **Right side – Image**
    
    * Create a large image area occupying approximately 45–50% of the section width.
    * I will provide/purchase the final image separately. **Do not generate an image.**
    * Implement this as an easily replaceable Shopify image setting/image picker.
    * The image should fill its available area cleanly without distortion.
    * Use `object-fit: cover`.
    * Keep the important subject area visible across different screen sizes.
    * The image height should visually align with the content area on desktop.
    
    ### Important
    
    Do **not** include the handwritten text “Medizin für Menschen.” from the reference image. This does not need to be recreated.
    
    The reference should only be used for the general composition, spacing, proportions and visual direction.
    
    ### Responsive behavior
    
    The section must be fully responsive and optimized for desktop, tablet and mobile.
    
    **Desktop:**
    
    * Two-column layout.
    * Text approximately 50–55% width.
    * Image approximately 45–50% width.
    * Vertically center the content within the section.
    * Maintain generous horizontal spacing.
    
    **Tablet:**
    
    * Keep the two-column layout as long as there is sufficient space.
    * Reduce headline size, padding and column gap proportionally.
    * Prevent the paragraph from becoming too narrow.
    * If the available width becomes insufficient, switch automatically to the mobile layout.
    
    **Mobile:**
    
    * Switch to a single-column layout.
    * Display the text content first and the image underneath.
    * The eyebrow, headline, paragraph and bold closing sentence must remain left-aligned.
    * Reduce horizontal padding appropriately for smaller screens.
    * The headline must scale down without awkward line breaks.
    * The image should use the full content width below the text.
    * Use a suitable mobile aspect ratio so the image does not become excessively tall.
    * Preserve the image focal point when cropping.
    * Do not allow horizontal scrolling, overlapping elements or clipped text.
    
    ### Shopify requirements
    
    Build this as a reusable Shopify section with Theme Editor settings for:
    
    * Eyebrow text
    * Heading
    * Main paragraph
    * Bold closing sentence
    * Desktop image
    * Optional separate mobile image
    * Image focal point/position where technically possible
    * Section spacing/padding
    
    All text and images must be editable through the Shopify Theme Editor without changing the code.
    
    Match the existing DocMed typography, colors, content width, border radii and spacing system wherever possible instead of introducing a separate design system.
    
    The final result should feel clean, modern, medical and professional while remaining visually consistent with the existing DocMed storefront.
    , bild ist mir zu hoch ein wenig kleiner 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;background:{{ block.settings.background_color }};color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};}
.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.08fr) minmax(0,.92fr);width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto;gap:{{ block.settings.column_gap }}px;padding:{{ block.settings.padding_vertical }}px 0;align-items:center;}
.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;min-width:0;padding:20px clamp(24px,5vw,88px) 20px clamp(24px,7vw,120px);}
.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow{margin:0 0 20px;color:{{ block.settings.eyebrow_color }};font-family:var(--font-body-family);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;line-height:1.4;text-transform:uppercase;}
.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading{margin:0 0 28px;color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }};font-family:var(--font-heading-family);font-size:clamp(44px,5.2vw,78px);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.035em;line-height:.98;}
.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy,.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__closing{max-width:620px;font-family:var(--font-body-family);font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;}.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy{margin:0 0 22px;}.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy p{margin:0;}.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__closing{margin:0;color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }};font-weight:700;}
.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media{position:relative;min-width:0;height:{{ block.settings.desktop_image_height }}px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:{{ block.settings.image_radius }}px;background:#eef3f4;}.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media img,.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;}.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media img{object-fit:cover;object-position:{{ block.settings.image_position }};}.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#647681;}.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg{width:100%;height:100%;max-width:520px;max-height:520px;}.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty-state{position:absolute;right:20px;bottom:20px;left:20px;padding:10px 14px;color:#465963;background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);border-radius:4px;font-family:var(--font-body-family);font-size:13px;text-align:center;}
@media screen and (max-width:989px){.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{gap:{{ block.settings.column_gap | times: 0.7 | round }}px;padding-top:{{ block.settings.padding_vertical | times: 0.75 | round }}px;padding-bottom:{{ block.settings.padding_vertical | times: 0.75 | round }}px;}.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content{padding-right:20px;padding-left:32px;}.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy,.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__closing{font-size:15px;}.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media{height:{{ block.settings.desktop_image_height | times: 0.8 | round }}px;}}
@media screen and (max-width:749px){.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{display:flex;flex-direction:column;width:100%;gap:28px;padding:{{ block.settings.mobile_padding }}px 20px;}.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content{padding:12px 0 0;}.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow{margin-bottom:15px;font-size:11px;}.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading{margin-bottom:22px;font-size:clamp(42px,13vw,60px);}.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy,.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__closing{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;}.ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media{height:auto;aspect-ratio:4/3;border-radius:{{ block.settings.image_radius | at_most: 8 }}px;}}
{% endstyle %}
<div class="ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner"><div class="ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__content">{% if block.settings.eyebrow != blank %}<p class="ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.heading != blank %}<h1 class="ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h1>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.paragraph != blank %}<div class="ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy">{{ block.settings.paragraph }}</div>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.closing != blank %}<p class="ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__closing">{{ block.settings.closing | escape }}</p>{% endif %}</div><div class="ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media">{% if block.settings.desktop_image != blank %}<picture>{% if block.settings.mobile_image != blank %}<source media="(max-width: 749px)" srcset="{{ block.settings.mobile_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}">{% endif %}<img src="{{ block.settings.desktop_image | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.desktop_image.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ block.settings.desktop_image.width }}" height="{{ block.settings.desktop_image.height }}"></picture>{% else %}<div class="ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}<div class="ai-about-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty-state">Füge ein Bild für den About-Us-Bereich hinzu.</div></div>{% endif %}</div></div></div>
{% schema %}{"name":"About Us hero","settings":[{"type":"header","content":"Content"},{"type":"text","id":"eyebrow","label":"Eyebrow","default":"MENSCHEN. PRODUKTE. BESSERE GESUNDHEIT."},{"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Heading","default":"Über uns"},{"type":"richtext","id":"paragraph","label":"Paragraph","default":"<p>Für uns ist Gesundheitswesen zutiefst persönlich. Hinter jedem medizinischen Produkt steht jemand, der darauf angewiesen ist – ein Patient, eine Gesundheitsfachkraft, ein Betreuer oder eine Person, die ihre Gesundheit und ihr Wohlbefinden verbessern möchte.</p>"},{"type":"text","id":"closing","label":"Closing sentence","default":"Bei DocMed verlieren wir das niemals aus den Augen."},{"type":"header","content":"Images"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"desktop_image","label":"Desktop image"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"mobile_image","label":"Mobile image"},{"type":"select","id":"image_position","label":"Image focal point","options":[{"value":"center center","label":"Center"},{"value":"center top","label":"Top"},{"value":"center bottom","label":"Bottom"},{"value":"left center","label":"Left"},{"value":"right center","label":"Right"}],"default":"center center"},{"type":"header","content":"Layout"},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_image_height","label":"Image height","min":300,"max":800,"step":25,"unit":"px","default":500},{"type":"range","id":"column_gap","label":"Column gap","min":0,"max":80,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":25},{"type":"range","id":"padding_vertical","label":"Desktop spacing","min":0,"max":120,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":40},{"type":"range","id":"mobile_padding","label":"Mobile spacing","min":0,"max":80,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":30},{"type":"range","id":"image_radius","label":"Image radius","min":0,"max":40,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":8},{"type":"header","content":"Colors"},{"type":"color","id":"background_color","label":"Background","default":"#ffffff"},{"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Body text","default":"#1d2e40"},{"type":"color","id":"heading_color","label":"Heading text","default":"#011f2d"},{"type":"color","id":"eyebrow_color","label":"Eyebrow text","default":"#1d2e40"}],"presets":[{"name":"About Us hero"}],"tag":null,"class":"about-us-hero-block"}{% endschema %}